[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     14[0m:[38;5;10m[49m this file records what was checked, and how the test suite itself was validated.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     15[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     16[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Build and run commands
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     17[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     18[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | | command | binary |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     19[0m:[38;5;10m[49m |---|---|---|
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     20[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | C | `cd c_src && mkdir -p build && cd build && cmake .. && cmake --build .` | `c_src/build/driver` |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     21[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | Rust | `cd translation && cargo build --release` | `translation/target/release/driver` |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     22[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
